WEBVTT

00:13.917 --> 00:16.547
THE LAID-OFF CHEAT-GRANTING MAGE
ENJOYS A SECOND LEASE ON LIFE

01:32.017 --> 01:35.237
That weakling was all bark and no bite.

01:38.567 --> 01:40.807
Let's go kill the rest of them.

01:40.807 --> 01:42.357
Yeah.

01:43.357 --> 01:45.207
W-Wait.

01:47.807 --> 01:50.797
She's persistent.

01:50.797 --> 01:51.897
Let's kill her.

01:56.547 --> 02:02.817
Kill me if you want, 
but I won't go down easily.

02:03.687 --> 02:05.067
Actually...

02:07.837 --> 02:10.317
There's a better way.

02:10.807 --> 02:15.697
You'll leave with only your fear 
and spend the rest of your life

02:15.697 --> 02:18.747
terrified of the past.

02:19.907 --> 02:25.667
We'll make you forget everything 
that happened here.

02:33.587 --> 02:36.137
We have nothing to be afraid of.

02:37.087 --> 02:41.167
This girl hasn't changed since then.

02:42.027 --> 02:46.647
You want that boy to strike 
this mark you put on our chest?

02:46.917 --> 02:48.977
Don't be absurd!

02:57.247 --> 03:01.697
The most powerful attack is 
meaningless if it doesn't land.

03:01.697 --> 03:06.207
Look. The boy is way down there now.

03:18.247 --> 03:22.997
You're powerless to do 
anything again, girl!

03:23.517 --> 03:25.687
My name isn't "girl."

03:26.337 --> 03:29.027
That feeble boy is Rein.

03:31.057 --> 03:32.317
And I...

03:33.647 --> 03:35.907
am Lily Flambert!

03:38.867 --> 03:41.147
Your scales are the ultimate armor,

03:41.147 --> 03:44.077
but when you move, gaps form between them!

03:44.497 --> 03:46.257
Why, you...

03:52.597 --> 03:55.257
My blade has reached your nerves.

03:55.257 --> 03:59.767
Every move you make will send tremors up 
your neck and cause excruciating pain.

04:00.137 --> 04:02.977
You can't escape anymore!

04:02.977 --> 04:06.307
Damn you, girl!

04:06.307 --> 04:10.987
Pull yourself together, 
Right! Are you okay?

04:11.257 --> 04:11.987
STAB

04:13.417 --> 04:15.487
Rein, strike the mark!

04:15.487 --> 04:19.257
If you focus your attack on a single 
point, you can pierce its heart!

04:19.257 --> 04:20.537
Got it!

04:20.537 --> 04:23.517
I'm coming!

04:26.917 --> 04:29.307
<i>Everyone's armor has reached its limit.</i>

04:29.827 --> 04:34.177
<i>If I fail, we'll all die!</i>

04:34.797 --> 04:39.807
YOU'RE PERSISTENT, GIRL... YOU HAVEN'T CHANGED
AT ALL, AND YOU'RE POWERLESS TO DO ANYTHING
AGAIN... BUT STILL, I AM LILY FLAMBERT!

04:40.177 --> 04:43.557
Ow, it hurts.

04:43.557 --> 04:46.347
Say something, Right.

04:46.347 --> 04:49.817
Have you thrown in the towel?

04:49.817 --> 04:54.817
<i>That boy will come right up 
to us to stab us in the heart.</i>

04:54.817 --> 05:01.027
<i>If we wait for that moment, we can 
crush him before the girl's eyes.</i>

05:02.727 --> 05:04.787
Rein, they're going to 
hit you with their tail!

05:04.787 --> 05:06.547
Swing your sword from there!

05:06.547 --> 05:09.417
You can do plenty of damage 
from that distance!

05:12.687 --> 05:14.207
Rein, are you listening?!

05:15.417 --> 05:21.467
D-Don't worry. I'll j-jump out 
of the way of their t-tail.

05:21.467 --> 05:23.217
You don't have the energy for that!

05:23.547 --> 05:26.767
<i>This boy is a total amateur.</i>

05:27.787 --> 05:31.647
I'll stab it right in the heart!

05:31.647 --> 05:34.487
You can't dodge their tail, you idiot!

05:34.487 --> 05:37.197
Don't try to show off, numbnuts!

05:37.197 --> 05:40.697
But if I swing from back here, 
I can't avoid hitting you!

05:41.537 --> 05:44.367
You won't be able to withstand the blast!

05:44.927 --> 05:45.947
He...

05:45.947 --> 05:47.977
He's thinking of us?

05:48.367 --> 05:52.267
Rein, we'll defend ourselves! 
Just swing your sword!

05:52.267 --> 05:55.167
We'll all die if you keep 
worrying about that!

06:08.637 --> 06:11.877
Hurry up and swing!

06:11.877 --> 06:13.287
You're always such a creep!

06:13.287 --> 06:15.117
Who wears dirt-colored clothes?!

06:15.117 --> 06:17.147
Did your grandma buy those for you?!

06:17.147 --> 06:20.407
Victory requires sacrifices 
and taking risks.

06:20.407 --> 06:23.327
The boy doesn't realize that!

06:24.097 --> 06:25.577
Rein!

06:28.207 --> 06:30.307
AAAAAHHH

06:31.147 --> 06:33.107
What the hell?!

06:31.227 --> 06:35.377
KILL

06:33.107 --> 06:35.377
What did I say, brat?!

06:38.047 --> 06:40.837
Your lack of experience makes you naïve!

06:40.837 --> 06:43.067
That is why you lost!

06:43.507 --> 06:46.387
You're the naïve one!

06:47.717 --> 06:52.137
You drew me in as close as 
possible so you could kill me.

06:52.137 --> 06:55.567
But even as an amateur, 
from that distance...

06:56.177 --> 07:00.607
I can hit a target by throwing my sword!

07:04.017 --> 07:06.257
I-Impossible!

07:06.257 --> 07:12.397
No human should be this s-strong!

07:12.397 --> 07:15.837
You're like a god or devil!

07:31.277 --> 07:32.577
It's dead.

07:34.157 --> 07:35.507
Ow...

07:36.057 --> 07:38.057
It hurts...

07:40.277 --> 07:49.987
I wanted to live a more fun and peaceful 
life, but Right was stronger than me.

07:49.987 --> 07:53.627
He threatened me with shoulder 
punches and made me do as he said.

07:53.627 --> 07:55.037
He made me run errands.

07:55.037 --> 08:01.307
It was always my job to clean up dog 
shit, too, even though it was his dog.

08:01.307 --> 08:05.587
I hate this life. It sucks.

08:05.987 --> 08:08.847
Yeah, that sounds really rough.

08:11.417 --> 08:13.667
What is this? A submachine gun?

08:13.667 --> 08:15.097
It's a freaking Uzi!

08:15.557 --> 08:16.687
<i>Crap!</i>

08:16.687 --> 08:20.737
<i>I was going to lower their guard with 
a sob story before shooting them!</i>

08:20.737 --> 08:22.107
<i>What a blunder!</i>

08:22.677 --> 08:24.827
I didn't think you had 
something like this.

08:24.827 --> 08:27.117
That's an impressive weapon.

08:27.117 --> 08:31.227
W-Wait, no. This is too cruel.

08:36.237 --> 08:37.497
S-Spare m—

08:48.557 --> 08:52.307
<i>That was close, but I survived.</i>

08:52.307 --> 08:55.937
<i>My heart's busted, but I 
think I can manage somehow.</i>

08:55.937 --> 08:59.017
<i>That bitch didn't have 
the guts to shoot me.</i>

08:59.017 --> 09:03.007
<i>This is why her whole party died.</i>

09:03.007 --> 09:07.197
<i>Imbecile! Idiot! I hope you die!</i>

09:15.077 --> 09:18.587
You can't let your guard 
down around monsters.

09:20.747 --> 09:22.627
Anyway, where's Rein?

09:24.757 --> 09:25.807
Rein!

09:27.517 --> 09:31.757
How are my left arm and leg?

09:32.057 --> 09:34.347
Th-They're totally fine.

09:34.607 --> 09:37.087
Ow, it hurts...

09:37.087 --> 09:38.377
You sound like the Radiant Dragon.

09:38.377 --> 09:39.287
That's hilarious.

09:43.417 --> 09:46.017
Thanks, Lily and Margaret.

09:46.017 --> 09:46.917
One million yen.

09:46.917 --> 09:48.157
One million yen.

09:49.327 --> 09:50.147
Rein.

09:50.567 --> 09:53.207
You defeated the Radiant Dragon.

09:53.207 --> 09:57.197
You focused your attack on a single 
point, just like you intended.

09:57.197 --> 09:58.597
This was your achievement.

09:59.497 --> 10:00.687
No.

10:02.637 --> 10:05.417
I couldn't have beaten it alone.

10:05.877 --> 10:07.397
It's because I had you two.

10:09.557 --> 10:10.887
Ow...

10:10.887 --> 10:11.557
Can you stand?

10:11.557 --> 10:12.257
Careful!

10:12.257 --> 10:14.197
He'll grope your chest and butt!

10:14.897 --> 10:16.367
No, I won't!

10:17.507 --> 10:19.327
What? Did you really?

10:19.327 --> 10:20.727
No!

10:20.727 --> 10:25.477
GUFFAW

10:25.887 --> 10:27.597
Rein, lean on me!

10:27.597 --> 10:29.237
Can I really?

10:29.777 --> 10:31.337
Where are those hands going?!

10:34.157 --> 10:38.247
I would've died without 
the armor you gave me.

10:38.607 --> 10:43.087
Same. I would've died if you 
hadn't enchanted my armor.

10:43.087 --> 10:46.337
Same. You saved my life, Rein.

10:46.337 --> 10:50.337
I would've died without 
the armor you gave me.

10:50.337 --> 10:52.507
Stop. Why are you repeating yourself?

10:57.377 --> 10:59.297
<i>Everyone has value!</i>

10:59.297 --> 11:02.427
<i>That obviously includes you!</i>

11:17.747 --> 11:20.207
What is this?

11:21.357 --> 11:22.287
<i>Mirabelle.</i>

11:23.247 --> 11:25.867
This man hired you to kill someone.

11:25.867 --> 11:26.707
Mom!

11:26.707 --> 11:32.127
FAMILY

11:27.937 --> 11:31.257
I'm sorry! I'll kill them next time!

11:31.727 --> 11:33.737
Forgive me, Mom!

11:31.727 --> 11:35.027
Look at how desperate he is!

11:35.377 --> 11:38.097
He's desperate to be loved!

11:38.097 --> 11:41.267
Honestly, it's disgusting.

11:41.637 --> 11:47.977
Mirabelle, you and everyone 
else are worthless.

11:47.977 --> 11:50.417
That's why it's okay to kill them.

11:50.777 --> 11:58.027
But when you kill your 
targets, I love you.

11:59.087 --> 12:03.527
That's right. I'm worthless.

12:04.917 --> 12:06.167
<i>I'm sorry, Rein.</i>

12:06.697 --> 12:10.707
<i>I have to kill you.</i>

12:11.417 --> 12:13.797
Whoa, the Radiant Dragon 
didn't disappoint.

12:13.797 --> 12:15.517
I got 5,000 points from it.

12:16.457 --> 12:21.217
<i>I fought. I actually managed to fight.</i>

12:22.087 --> 12:23.757
Hey, hey, hey!

12:23.757 --> 12:25.447
What are you striking a cool pose for?

12:25.447 --> 12:27.547
What are you, a middle school kid?

12:27.547 --> 12:29.877
It's been weeks since the hot summer 
of your second year of middle school!

12:29.877 --> 12:31.287
Oh, thinking about mine got me fired up!

12:31.287 --> 12:32.897
Global warming keeps 
ceaselessly advancing!

12:32.897 --> 12:34.647
What is wrong with you?!

12:34.867 --> 12:37.227
Let me see that cool pose again!

12:37.227 --> 12:38.057
You're so annoying.

12:43.527 --> 12:47.877
I won't let you hurt them, 
Mirabelle the assassin.

12:48.407 --> 12:51.397
Not only are you slower 
compared to when we met,

12:51.397 --> 12:53.857
but you also weren't completely hidden.

12:53.857 --> 12:54.687
Mirabelle.

12:54.687 --> 12:56.657
S-Stay away from me!

13:03.307 --> 13:12.777
Rein, when you were nice to me and said 
I wasn't worthless, I felt kind of happy.

13:13.467 --> 13:19.837
It made me think others have value 
and that I'd like to cherish them.

13:21.577 --> 13:25.047
What is this? What is this feeling?

13:26.297 --> 13:30.177
Until now, I saw no difference 
between people, bugs, and beasts.

13:30.997 --> 13:33.747
They were just lumps of flesh.

13:34.347 --> 13:38.337
But now I can't kill anyone anymore!

13:39.547 --> 13:43.777
At this rate, because of 
you... because of you...

13:44.767 --> 13:47.227
Mom will abandon me.

13:48.937 --> 13:49.687
I'm sorry.

13:49.687 --> 13:50.767
He apologized!

13:51.097 --> 13:52.407
Mom...

13:52.917 --> 13:56.307
Mirabelle, I'll help you think.

13:56.307 --> 13:59.567
You can think while you walk, right?

13:59.567 --> 14:01.477
Come on, Mirabelle. Come with us.

14:03.457 --> 14:05.977
Did you forget why we came here?

14:10.167 --> 14:11.057
It's Poophead!

14:11.057 --> 14:14.417
Seriously, screw you! Help me already!

14:14.417 --> 14:16.567
Sexy! Sexy!

14:16.567 --> 14:18.047
Hey!

14:16.597 --> 14:23.667
Sexy! Sexy! Sexy!

14:18.047 --> 14:19.717
Hey, Mirabelle!

14:19.717 --> 14:21.357
You little brat!

14:21.357 --> 14:23.907
Hurry up and kill them!

14:23.907 --> 14:26.697
I-I earned my pay.

14:26.697 --> 14:29.727
If I hadn't fought the Radiant 
Dragon, we'd all be dead.

14:29.727 --> 14:31.597
I don't care! Kill them!

14:31.597 --> 14:32.977
Kill them, kill them, kill them!

14:33.227 --> 14:37.117
If you don't, your mom 
will never love you again!

14:37.117 --> 14:43.437
I bet Rein told you people aren't 
worthless, but that's a lie!

14:43.437 --> 14:44.117
A lie?

14:44.117 --> 14:45.567
Of course it is!

14:45.567 --> 14:48.567
You'd have killed him if 
he hadn't tricked you!

14:48.567 --> 14:50.927
Of course he lied!

14:50.927 --> 14:53.547
But it didn't sound like a lie to me.

14:53.547 --> 14:58.867
Do you really think Rein's going to 
be your weekend bowling buddy now?

14:59.667 --> 15:03.177
Mirabelle, you've killed dozens of people!

15:03.177 --> 15:06.417
Normal people don't associate 
with someone like you!

15:06.417 --> 15:08.467
They think you're nuts!

15:08.467 --> 15:12.937
You're not just worthless, you're 
evil! Who's going to love you?

15:12.937 --> 15:14.437
Your mom!

15:14.437 --> 15:18.637
So you should keep killing people 
at your mom's direction!

15:19.317 --> 15:20.867
That's enough.

15:20.867 --> 15:23.407
Mirabelle's doing her best to change!

15:23.407 --> 15:25.947
Why would you say such 
cruel things to her?

15:25.947 --> 15:29.237
Did you guys hear the 
cheesy shit he just said?

15:29.237 --> 15:33.847
It's like I'm relaxing in a warm living 
room and watching TV with my pet dog!

15:35.457 --> 15:38.957
It's not a lie! It's not!

15:38.957 --> 15:40.967
Ow!

15:41.197 --> 15:44.297
Trust me, Mirabelle! People are worthless!

15:44.297 --> 15:45.517
Your mom is all you have!

15:45.517 --> 15:47.717
Killing people is awesome! Hooray, murder!

15:47.717 --> 15:49.517
He's lying, Mirabelle!

15:49.517 --> 15:52.947
You can't trust people who 
say people are worthless!

15:53.477 --> 15:56.227
I don't know what's right.

15:56.227 --> 15:58.727
Then let me break it down for you!

15:58.727 --> 16:02.857
First, Mirabelle, you're a 
mass murderer! You're worthless!

16:02.857 --> 16:06.117
Then there's other people! Suppose you 
see a stranger on the side of the road...

16:06.117 --> 16:09.617
People have value!

16:09.617 --> 16:13.117
They do! They do! They do! They do!

16:11.117 --> 16:13.117
What are you shouting for, Rein?

16:13.457 --> 16:16.877
They do, they do, they 
do, they do, they do!

16:16.877 --> 16:20.627
AAAAAHHH

16:18.967 --> 16:19.927
Mirabelle.

16:20.627 --> 16:25.387
AAAAAHHH

16:20.897 --> 16:24.517
Rein is trying to tell you 
that people aren't worthless.

16:24.277 --> 16:25.387
COUGH

16:25.387 --> 16:29.387
AAAAAHHH

16:25.877 --> 16:29.387
Look at how hard he's 
willing to try for you.

16:29.387 --> 16:34.577
AAAAAHHH

16:29.837 --> 16:34.127
Doesn't that make you feel 
like you're worth something?

16:34.577 --> 16:39.567
AAAAAHHH

16:37.257 --> 16:39.567
Yeah, it does.

16:39.567 --> 16:45.837
AAAAAHHH

16:39.797 --> 16:45.777
Rein said something similar 
to me once, and I...

16:45.777 --> 16:46.317
Hey!

16:46.317 --> 16:48.317
Whoa, you scared me!

16:54.437 --> 16:55.747
Goblins!

16:56.147 --> 16:59.697
S-Sorry, it's my fault for shouting.

17:00.277 --> 17:02.227
Whispering now won't fix anything!

17:02.227 --> 17:03.547
Mirabelle!

17:03.907 --> 17:05.137
Help me!

17:05.137 --> 17:07.337
Are you going to let me die?

17:07.337 --> 17:12.597
FINE! I'LL AT LEAST LEAVE A MARK
ON YOU BEFORE I DIE, DAMN IT!

17:07.337 --> 17:12.597
GOODBYE FOREVER!

17:07.617 --> 17:09.867
You're killing me, then?

17:09.867 --> 17:12.597
So you're a murderer!

17:12.597 --> 17:14.757
You're worthless after all!

17:13.297 --> 17:17.017
We should run. Ignore his nonsense.

17:14.757 --> 17:18.507
I bet you'll keep killing 
people like your mom says!

17:17.187 --> 17:20.547
I bet he's thinking, "Fine! I'll 
at least leave a mark on you

17:20.547 --> 17:23.117
before I die, damn it! Goodbye forever!"

17:25.727 --> 17:26.337
She's fast!

17:26.337 --> 17:27.567
Mirabelle, what are you doing?

17:27.867 --> 17:30.897
Cornelius, I'll tell Mom.

17:31.877 --> 17:36.497
I'll tell her I'm not worthless, 
so I won't kill people anymore.

17:37.427 --> 17:42.247
If that makes her abandon me, then fine.

17:42.917 --> 17:49.757
I'll find allies who trust, support, 
and work hard for each other!

17:51.597 --> 17:52.347
Mirabelle!

17:52.347 --> 17:53.387
The goblins!

17:54.057 --> 18:00.227
So I won't use this power 
to kill people anymore!

18:02.657 --> 18:04.647
I'll use it to save lives!

18:15.857 --> 18:17.397
Wow.

18:18.657 --> 18:20.177
She took them out with one attack.

18:22.537 --> 18:24.317
Don't be afraid, Cornelius.

18:25.927 --> 18:27.437
I am strong.

18:30.757 --> 18:33.427
Cornelius will never hurt you again.

18:33.917 --> 18:35.427
I'll make sure of it.

18:35.427 --> 18:36.437
Okay.

18:36.437 --> 18:37.527
We appreciate it.

18:39.017 --> 18:42.817
Mirabelle, what do you 
think Lefaid is like?

18:43.387 --> 18:45.617
What? I don't know.

18:45.617 --> 18:46.647
Want to see?

18:48.097 --> 18:49.987
Yeah, I do!

18:49.987 --> 18:52.527
Yeah? Then I'm not showing you.

18:52.527 --> 18:54.367
Go home with Cornelius today.

18:54.367 --> 18:55.097
What?

18:55.097 --> 18:56.327
Why?

18:56.327 --> 18:57.497
Shut up, walleye.

18:57.497 --> 19:02.507
It might take courage to 
tell your mom how you feel,

19:02.507 --> 19:05.007
but I believe you can do it.

19:05.537 --> 19:07.837
Come see us once you have.

19:07.837 --> 19:09.777
I'll show you the sword then.

19:12.297 --> 19:16.887
Okay. I promise I'll come back 
as soon as I've told my mom.

19:16.887 --> 19:19.907
It's a promise. Good luck.

19:25.407 --> 19:28.097
Even Rein can be sensible sometimes.

19:28.097 --> 19:29.237
I know, right?

19:29.237 --> 19:32.487
What do you mean? I'm always sensible.

19:33.087 --> 19:35.137
He said that with a straight face!

19:35.137 --> 19:37.237
I-Is he mad?

19:37.237 --> 19:41.047
I always get things done when it counts.

19:41.047 --> 19:43.207
You attracted those goblins by shouting!

19:43.207 --> 19:46.037
And you've acted like an idiot 
at plenty of inappropriate times!

19:48.847 --> 19:50.517
Ugh, gross.

19:50.517 --> 19:52.797
Never smile again.

19:58.077 --> 20:01.557
This place looks worthy 
of a legendary sword!

20:01.557 --> 20:04.897
The excitement and anticipation 
is making me short of breath!

20:05.507 --> 20:06.877
You're already breathing heavily.

20:11.787 --> 20:13.087
This is definitely it.

20:15.567 --> 20:17.077
Lefaid.

20:19.567 --> 20:21.897
That sword belongs to you, Rein.

20:22.347 --> 20:23.457
Right.

20:40.557 --> 20:44.627
So this... is Lefaid.

20:50.527 --> 20:55.357
How much do you think 
I grew on this adventure?

21:00.457 --> 21:06.367
Well, if you take a look outside, 
the world might look different now.

21:06.677 --> 21:10.527
Yeah, I'm sure it will.

21:10.527 --> 21:12.847
You think so, too?

21:12.847 --> 21:14.127
Totally.

21:28.127 --> 21:29.977
It's so bright!

22:07.687 --> 22:09.187
LILY

22:13.357 --> 22:14.527
SHE SAID REIN!!

22:13.357 --> 22:14.527
IS SHE...

22:13.357 --> 22:14.527
TALKING ABOUT MEEE?!

22:14.527 --> 22:19.527
TRANSLATION: SHO STIFLER
TIMING: ANDY ELLIS

22:14.527 --> 22:24.987
ROLEPLAYING LIFE

22:20.157 --> 22:24.947
EDITING: ALICIA ASHBY
QUALITY CONTROL: WILLIAM HAGGARD

22:24.987 --> 22:29.747
FINAL QUALITY CONTROL: BECKY COTTRILL

22:35.087 --> 22:35.757
HEY!

22:35.757 --> 22:46.137
REIN CRASHES THE STAGE

22:35.757 --> 22:38.757
YOU WERE TALKING ABOUT ME, RIGHT?!

22:35.757 --> 22:38.757
LILY!!

22:38.757 --> 22:39.507
RIGHT?!

22:39.507 --> 22:40.257
HEY!

22:40.257 --> 22:41.007
LILY!!

22:41.007 --> 22:41.757
